WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:07.520
Part seventeen: add a worker by hand. When someone is working a stand but never signed up, put them on it.

00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:10.717
Add a worker by hand is in Hub tools.

00:00:10.917 --> 00:00:12.550
Tap it.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.617
Pick the stand.

00:00:14.817 --> 00:00:21.687
Their full name and email. The email matters on a stand with no lead: that's where their own time log link goes.

00:00:21.887 --> 00:00:23.999
A phone if you have it, and their role.

00:00:24.199 --> 00:00:28.275
Who the hours count for: a student's full name, or General fund.

00:00:28.475 --> 00:00:30.450
Tap Add worker.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:40.230
They're on the stand, matched to their volunteer record, or added as a new volunteer. A SignUp.com import won't drop them.
